# The SDK's feedforward item tables (SDK Arm::ff_vec_items and friends).
#
# Static tables, not a firmware read: they say which item numbers exist and what they
# are called. Entries are "item: name". The read-only list is the subset that cannot
# be written through set_feedforward_scalar.


---
bool success
string message
string[] vector_items
string[] scalar_items
string[] scalar_read_only_items
